      {
        "id": 234976,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-02-03T17:59:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Quick terminology clarification for folks that can make a significant impact when reading how things work: Boost/Hinder are actions that are taken, while Bonus/Penalty are types of Mods, which are generated by Boost and Hinder actions. :-)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>As to what actually Destroys a Mod, I think catDreaming and TakeWalker nailed it: Something only destroys a Mod if it says it destroys a Mod. ;-) Using a Mod or using an Overcome to remove a Mod just remove&nbsp;the Mod.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This might be a good question to send in to the Letters Page podcast to verify, but I'm pretty sure this is as intended.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:11:11.982Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
